# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fields Driller .gitignore
# Internal authoring docs and workflow artifacts that should never
# appear on the public GitHub repo. The app code (engine.js,
# widgets/, styles.css, index.html, topic_d1_gravitation.js,
# README.md) IS published — everything else here is private to the
# authoring workflow.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Authoring brief and related sub-chat coordination
AUTHORING_BRIEF.md
SUBCHAT_*.md

# Inter-chat coordination protocol and threads (2026-06-03 onward).
# The protocol file plus everything in the inter_chat/ folder.
INTER_CHAT_PROTOCOL.md
inter_chat/

# State snapshots for the super-architect (may appear at this root in
# future even though the primary STATE doc lives at OneDrive).
STATE_*.md

# Internal audit, feedback, and flag docs (any *_FEEDBACK.md, *_AUDIT_*.md,
# FLAG_*.md). The pattern keeps future docs of this shape auto-ignored.
*_FEEDBACK.md
*_AUDIT_*.md
FLAG_*.md

# Scratch / draft / notes folders, if any appear later
notes/
private/
drafts/
scratch/
INTERNAL_*

# ─── OS clutter ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db

# ─── Editor / IDE clutter ─────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
*.tmp
.history/

# ─── Node / build tooling (if any of these ever land) ─────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/
*.log
